repository-code: 'https://github.com/juheekim-maker/PBPK-Pb-Korean-Cohorts'
abstract: >-
  Python implementation of a reduced-form perinatal physiologically
  based model for lead, with grid-quadrature Bayesian calibration
  against two Korean birth cohorts. Version 1.1.0 adds the grid
  quadrature routine, the renal and lactational module, a variable
  dictionary (VARIABLES.md), and a parameter grid matching the
  4,992 nodes described in the article.
keywords:
  - PBPK
  - lead
  - pregnancy
  - lactation
  - placental transfer
  - Bayesian calibration
